Task 1: Set Up Resilience Patterns
Subtask 1.1: Verify Lab Environment and Deploy Sample Applications
First, let's verify that our Kubernetes cluster and Istio are properly configured.

# Check cluster status
kubectl cluster-info

# Verify Istio installation
